      "ref": "[D187]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A parent reports that strangers can message or voice chat with your child, and it is on by default.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "To make sure they have the best and safest experience possible, we have several resources and tools that you can utilize to tailor your child’s multiplayer experience."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D187]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "The game pushes in-app purchases, loot boxes, pay-to-win or subscription traps.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "In Bedrock Edition, you can access [Minecraft Marketplace](https://www.minecraft.net/marketplace) – a hub of purchasable maps, skins, and mini-games bought with the currency Minecoins, all of which are curated to ensure quality and safety."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D187]",
      "area": "data",
      "claim": "It collects data for ads or shares with third parties, and the data can be deleted.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Explains in detail Mojang Studios' mission and dedication to creating the safest player experience possible"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D187]",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A parent reports that the age gate works in practice.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "A child account is an account for those under the age of 16 for the US & EU, and 19 for South Korea, and cannot exist without an adult Microsoft account tied to it."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D187]",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A parent reports seeing mild violence such as hitting and defeating mobs and using weapons.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Players can hit and defeat (essentially, kill) both passive and hostile creatures (also known as ‘mobs’), as well as other players (if playing in multiplayer mode). There's also some use of weapons, such as swords, axes, bows, and TNT."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D187]",
      "area": "developer_record",
      "claim": "The developer has had fines, breaches, lawsuits or regulatory actions.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Explains in detail Mojang Studios' mission and dedication to creating the safest player experience possible"
    }
  ]
